WEBVTT

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:19.019
The seven-million-year history
of mankind is about to end.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:26.067
It is not due to a nuclear war
or an invasion by an alien race,

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:28.403
or even a collision with an asteroid.

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:30.905
Mankind now faces

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:36.494
its extinction, its end, at the hands of

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:41.332
none other than the creators
of mankind themselves, the gods!

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:46.713
GÖLL, YOUNGEST OF THE 13 VALKYRIE

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:50.508
The time has come, my sister, Brünnhilde.

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:57.390
THE COUNCIL OF VALHALLA, COUNCIL HALL

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.565
HERMES, ONE OF THE 12 GODS OF OLYMPUS

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:11.112
Now then, everyone, 1,000 years have
already passed since the last session.

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:13.615
Let us commence our meeting.

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:19.621
The Council on the Fate of Mankind
attended by all the gods of the world.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.540
The question is…

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:29.547
Do we allow mankind to continue
to exist for the next 1,000 years…

00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:35.512
or do we bring their existence to an end?

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:40.683
Gods and goddesses,
make your opinions known.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.185
Here's what I think.

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.481
They should be wiped out.

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:51.945
I've watched them these last 1,000 years,
but they have zero intention of reforming.

00:01:52.028 --> 00:01:54.072
Let's demolish the whole lot of them.

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.868
Yes, you are quite right, Shiva.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:00.829
These past 1,000 years,

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:03.540
the world has become
increasingly unpleasant.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.128
The oceans are filled with trash and oil,
the forests are dying out,

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:10.547
and creatures continue to go extinct.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.382
You could even say

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.509
mankind itself is a calamity

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:17.637
that is annihilating all living things
on the face of the earth.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.889
Aphrodite is right!

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.725
Mankind should be exterminated!

00:02:23.726 --> 00:02:25.395
Those scum are a pestilence!

00:02:26.729 --> 00:02:28.898
I'm weary of leading them.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.233
I couldn't agree more!

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:34.571
Well, it seems we've come to a decision.

00:02:35.113 --> 00:02:37.991
By unanimous vote,

00:02:38.074 --> 00:02:42.662
The Council on the Fate of Mankind
has decided to end--

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:44.164
Wait!

00:02:48.793 --> 00:02:50.170
-What?
-Who was that?

00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:56.926
Well, if it isn't a Valkyrie.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.553
It's a Valkyrie!

00:03:00.805 --> 00:03:03.308
What are you thinking, Brünnhilde?

00:03:03.391 --> 00:03:06.477
You can't stop the gods
from concluding a decision!

00:03:06.561 --> 00:03:11.357
With all due respect,
gods and goddesses, I have an objection.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.735
-Stay out of this, Brünnhilde!
-Stay out of this, Brünnhilde!

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:19.115
ODIN, SUPREME NORSE GOD

00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:21.659
You stupid half-breed god!

00:03:21.743 --> 00:03:24.537
This is a matter for the gods,
so butt out!

00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:27.415
You want to fight? Then bring it on!

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:32.545
Admittedly, mankind's tyranny
and atrocities are egregious.

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:34.505
How dare you ignore me!

00:03:34.589 --> 00:03:35.757
However,

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:39.260
simply eliminating them
would be too crude.

00:03:40.428 --> 00:03:41.721
I see.

00:03:41.804 --> 00:03:43.139
How about this?

00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:44.974
To determine

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:49.020
whether it is worth allowing mankind
to exist for another 1,000 years,

00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:54.984
demonstrate the mercy and power
of the gods by testing mankind.

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.319
Test them?

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.738
Do you want to flood the earth again?

00:03:58.821 --> 00:04:02.367
Or hasten the ice age and freeze them?

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:03.785
No.

00:04:04.327 --> 00:04:06.871
There is a more effective method.

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:08.248
What?

00:04:08.331 --> 00:04:09.332
What is she up to?

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:14.003
-Hey!
-What is she saying?

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:19.050
The final battle between god and man,

00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:21.010
Ragnarok!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.766
Ragnarok?

00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:35.858
As stipulated in the ultra-special clause
of Article 62, Paragraph 15

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.485
of the Constitution of Valhalla,

00:04:38.486 --> 00:04:43.825
it is "a one-on-one battle
between the gods and mankind."

00:04:44.534 --> 00:04:48.246
The Law of the Final Battle
Between God and Man,

00:04:48.329 --> 00:04:50.290
otherwise known as "Ragnarok."

00:04:50.873 --> 00:04:57.422
It is a tournament of one-on-one battles
between 13 humans and 13 gods.

00:04:57.964 --> 00:05:00.675
Whichever side achieves
seven victories first wins.

00:05:00.758 --> 00:05:05.096
The moment mankind loses seven times,
their destruction is decided.

00:05:05.179 --> 00:05:08.016
On the other hand, if mankind wins,

00:05:08.099 --> 00:05:11.060
their existence for
the next 1,000 years is guaranteed.

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:18.067
But this law has never once been applied
since the birth of mankind.

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:22.905
This is because humans defeating gods is

00:05:23.531 --> 00:05:25.700
utterly impossible!

00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:29.245
In other words,
the statute is a mere formality.

00:05:29.787 --> 00:05:34.459
It was established
purely as a joke by the gods.

00:05:42.925 --> 00:05:45.094
What a bunch of nonsense!

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:49.015
I would've thought
a Valkyrie like you would know.

00:05:49.098 --> 00:05:51.476
Humans are no match for gods!

00:05:51.559 --> 00:05:53.394
-It's a total waste of time!
-It's a total waste of time!

00:05:53.936 --> 00:05:55.229
That's right!

00:05:55.313 --> 00:05:56.939
It will be mere child's play!

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:59.776
What's the point in us
facing off against humans?

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.736
Utterly ludicrous!

00:06:02.737 --> 00:06:07.575
So I take it that it is the gods' opinion
that mankind should be eliminated…

00:06:08.493 --> 00:06:09.494
and…

00:06:10.328 --> 00:06:15.625
that you want to avoid
direct competition with humans?

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:16.834
-What?
-What?

00:06:16.918 --> 00:06:20.296
You want to eliminate mankind
without battling them?

00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:23.466
You don't want to fight them face-to-face?

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:26.969
Could it be? Is it possible that…

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:30.056
you are…

00:06:31.641 --> 00:06:38.648
chickening out?

00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:46.114
If that's true,
then please excuse me for interfering.

00:06:46.823 --> 00:06:48.324
Brünnhilde…

00:06:49.325 --> 00:06:52.495
Please ignore my remarks.

00:06:53.287 --> 00:06:56.499
Let's forget about Ragnarok and all that.

00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:00.086
Don't do that!

00:07:00.169 --> 00:07:03.464
You'll end up being eliminated
before mankind is!

00:07:03.548 --> 00:07:05.633
Please apologize to them!

00:07:05.716 --> 00:07:08.052
Brünnhilde!

00:07:13.641 --> 00:07:15.268
What?

00:07:15.852 --> 00:07:17.520
They're not angry?

00:07:32.201 --> 00:07:35.204
There's one thing
Brünnhilde was quite confident of.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:42.295
I knew it. The gods are
far more short-tempered than mankind.

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:52.263
I see. Ragnarok, right?

00:07:52.346 --> 00:07:55.016
I find your proposal intriguing.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:59.520
Thank you for bringing it up.
Quite intriguing.

00:07:59.604 --> 00:08:03.065
What do you say, everyone?

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:06.277
It's been a while,
so wouldn't you like to see

00:08:06.861 --> 00:08:11.240
the thundering of the gods

00:08:11.741 --> 00:08:14.994
and our overwhelming ferocity?

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:21.042
How about it, everyone?

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:24.545
Let us gods

00:08:24.629 --> 00:08:28.925
fight it out against mankind!

00:08:48.444 --> 00:08:51.739
Thus, the final battle
between god and man,

00:08:51.822 --> 00:08:54.659
Ragnarok, was unexpectedly approved!

00:08:56.953 --> 00:08:58.871
Brünnhilde.

00:09:01.457 --> 00:09:07.838
I would like you to select those
who will represent mankind.

00:09:08.464 --> 00:09:11.759
You want to assist mankind, don't you?

00:09:11.842 --> 00:09:15.304
After all,
you are one of the tragic Valkyries,

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:21.310
the half-god, half-human beings
who were once reduced to being humans.

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:22.478
Right?

00:09:28.693 --> 00:09:31.612
I shall select
the thirteen most powerful humans

00:09:31.696 --> 00:09:35.157
from mankind's
seven million years of history.

00:09:49.046 --> 00:09:53.968
RAGNAROK

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:06.939
VALHALLA ARENA

00:10:29.045 --> 00:10:32.214
It's about to begin, Brünnhilde.

00:10:32.798 --> 00:10:33.633
Yes.

00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:37.303
Who will be the first
to fight for the gods?

00:10:45.227 --> 00:10:48.272
For countless eons…

00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:49.315
HEIMDALL, WATCHMAN OF THE APOCALYPSE

00:10:49.398 --> 00:10:51.651
…I have waited to blow Gjallarhorn!

00:10:52.193 --> 00:10:57.323
To announce the start of the final battle
between god and man, Ragnarok!

00:10:58.199 --> 00:11:01.994
Hey, you all. Are you ready?

00:11:06.374 --> 00:11:07.667
The rules are simple.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:11.045
Victory is determined
when either a human or a god dies.

00:11:11.128 --> 00:11:15.925
In other words, when their existence
is permanently terminated.

00:11:17.385 --> 00:11:18.761
In the first bout,

00:11:19.762 --> 00:11:21.639
representing the gods is…

00:11:23.349 --> 00:11:24.350
this man!

00:11:29.772 --> 00:11:33.943
All the gods want to see
this guy get serious in a fight.

00:11:34.652 --> 00:11:36.987
His Mjölnir shatters continents.

00:11:37.071 --> 00:11:39.407
If this dude can't do it, then who can?

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.076
He lives and dies by war!

00:11:53.462 --> 00:11:55.131
The strongest Norse god,

00:11:55.923 --> 00:11:59.885
Thor!

00:12:03.848 --> 00:12:07.226
Yikes! It's Thor, god of thunder!

00:12:07.726 --> 00:12:10.771
There's no way we can win, Brünnhilde!

00:12:11.522 --> 00:12:13.274
Not to worry, Göll.

00:12:13.899 --> 00:12:15.901
I'm sure he will defeat him.

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:21.323
Of those whom I have met
on the battlefield, he is the strongest…

00:12:21.866 --> 00:12:26.537
In fact, he is the biggest badass
and most maniacal warrior of them all.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.540
MOST MANIACAL

00:12:29.623 --> 00:12:35.796
And the foolish human who will
represent mankind against the gods is

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.548
this man!

00:12:50.144 --> 00:12:53.355
Will the seven million years
of mankind's reign end here?

00:12:54.356 --> 00:12:55.232
-Nay!
-Nay!

00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:59.445
Will the seven million years
of mankind's glory be forgotten?

00:12:59.528 --> 00:13:00.571
-Nay!
-Nay!

00:13:10.372 --> 00:13:12.291
It's him…

00:13:21.425 --> 00:13:22.801
Goodness me!

00:13:22.885 --> 00:13:28.849
This man is here to maintain
the hopes and dreams of mankind!

00:13:29.391 --> 00:13:34.313
I ask you,
is there anyone other than this man

00:13:34.396 --> 00:13:36.524
who could defeat a god?

00:13:37.149 --> 00:13:37.983
-Nay!
-Nay!

00:13:38.817 --> 00:13:40.486
Is there any doubt that

00:13:40.569 --> 00:13:43.906
there is no one greater than him
in all of human history?

00:13:43.989 --> 00:13:45.241
-Nay!
-Nay!

00:13:50.371 --> 00:13:52.748
The most powerful of all Chinese heroes!

00:13:52.831 --> 00:13:57.628
Lü Bu!

00:14:02.216 --> 00:14:03.342
My lord…

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.807
Buddha, protect us.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:12.810
Buddha, protect us.

00:14:12.893 --> 00:14:16.146
You there, human. Cease your prayers.

00:14:18.524 --> 00:14:21.735
The enemy that we must defeat is…

00:14:24.697 --> 00:14:29.243
the very gods you are praying to now.

00:14:31.453 --> 00:14:35.875
With mankind's existence on the line
in their final battle with the gods,

00:14:35.958 --> 00:14:37.710
Ragnarok,

00:14:37.793 --> 00:14:41.380
we've got one hell of an opening bout!

00:14:42.089 --> 00:14:45.759
For the gods,
it's the strongest of the Norse gods,

00:14:45.843 --> 00:14:48.053
the berserker of thunder!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:53.100
Thor!

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:00.774
And the human challenger is…

00:15:07.156 --> 00:15:09.450
the strongest hero of the Three Kingdoms!

00:15:13.495 --> 00:15:18.292
Lü Bu!

00:15:26.508 --> 00:15:29.345
This is truly a battle
of strongest versus strongest!

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:33.223
The electricity in the stands
is also at max voltage!

00:15:34.975 --> 00:15:36.060
Thor!

00:15:36.143 --> 00:15:40.814
Annihilate that lowly human
with a single blow!

00:15:40.898 --> 00:15:42.775
Come on, Lü Bu!

00:15:43.609 --> 00:15:47.655
Hurry up and grind
that bastard of a god into mincemeat!

00:15:49.365 --> 00:15:51.158
"Mincemeat"?

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.708
Gods versus mankind!

00:15:59.792 --> 00:16:02.586
Nothing could go better
with liquor than this!

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.213
Isn't that right, mate?

00:16:05.923 --> 00:16:07.508
I don't quite get this.

00:16:07.591 --> 00:16:10.219
Wouldn't the greatest
of the Three Kingdoms be

00:16:10.302 --> 00:16:13.430
the one known as Yunchang
in his mortal years?

00:16:14.306 --> 00:16:16.600
In other words,
you, who have become a god?

00:16:17.726 --> 00:16:21.522
In terms of strategy and overall ability,
probably so.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:26.360
However, if judging entirely
by raw fighting power,

00:16:26.443 --> 00:16:28.654
the only possible conclusion is…

00:16:30.239 --> 00:16:33.033
that the strongest during
the Three Kingdoms Era

00:16:33.575 --> 00:16:35.577
is Lü Bu!

00:16:37.246 --> 00:16:38.747
No doubt about it!

00:16:39.707 --> 00:16:44.211
Yet, those in Lü Bu's army
never change, do they?

00:16:52.594 --> 00:16:56.598
My lord! We're all behind you!

00:16:56.682 --> 00:17:01.020
Whenever you fight in battle,
we'll always be there with you!

00:17:01.103 --> 00:17:04.773
To think that the day would come

00:17:05.357 --> 00:17:09.528
when I would see
my lord's gallant figure again, I…

00:17:11.447 --> 00:17:13.532
I'm overwhelmed!

00:17:14.533 --> 00:17:15.993
Brünnhilde,

00:17:16.744 --> 00:17:19.204
do you really think Lü Bu can win?

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.458
"Humans can't possibly defeat gods."

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.377
Is that what you think, Göll?

00:17:25.461 --> 00:17:27.921
Well, I mean…

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:34.053
I am sure that is what
all the gods here still think.

00:17:34.136 --> 00:17:35.888
That's exactly why we have a chance.

00:17:36.388 --> 00:17:39.516
This is the perfect moment
to bash their smug faces in

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.019
as they scoff at humans.

00:17:43.395 --> 00:17:45.147
Bash them in?

00:17:45.647 --> 00:17:47.191
Bash them in.

00:17:47.816 --> 00:17:49.318
Their smug faces?

00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:50.736
Their smug faces.

00:17:51.653 --> 00:17:52.613
You know,

00:17:53.155 --> 00:17:56.575
you can sometimes say
some pretty mean things.

00:17:59.995 --> 00:18:01.080
You have no idea

00:18:01.872 --> 00:18:03.999
how weary I've grown waiting

00:18:04.666 --> 00:18:07.544
for the day when I can blow this thing
with all my might!

00:18:13.509 --> 00:18:16.178
According to Edda,
the story of Norse mythology,

00:18:16.762 --> 00:18:20.057
when Heimdall, watchman of the apocalypse,

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.644
sounds the horn of the apocalypse,
Gjallarhorn,

00:18:24.645 --> 00:18:29.566
the final battle between god and man,
Ragnarok, will commence.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.154
Pulverize him.

00:18:37.658 --> 00:18:39.284
It's really going to start…

00:18:41.745 --> 00:18:44.414
The one-on-one battle
between gods and humans.

00:18:56.844 --> 00:18:58.762
THE FIRST BOUT IN THE FINAL BATTLE
BETWEEN GOD AND MAN

00:18:58.846 --> 00:19:00.764
THOR VS. LÜ BU

00:19:00.848 --> 00:19:04.268
THE BATTLE BEGINS!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:16.488
The battle between the strongest gods
and the strongest humans!

00:19:17.489 --> 00:19:20.075
The first bout
of this tournament is about…

00:19:21.493 --> 00:19:23.412
-What's that?
-Oh, my!

00:19:25.998 --> 00:19:29.001
Both combatants
have lowered their weapons!

00:19:29.084 --> 00:19:33.797
Their guard is down!
Neither of them is taking a stance!

00:19:40.304 --> 00:19:43.098
Now they're approaching one another!

00:19:43.182 --> 00:19:46.268
Unbelievably, both have started off
with their guard down!

00:19:46.351 --> 00:19:50.147
What's more, they're both casually
closing the distance between them!

00:19:51.356 --> 00:19:54.735
So they couldn't care less
how the other comes at them.

00:19:54.818 --> 00:19:58.155
Neither of them has any intention
of sizing up the other.

00:19:58.238 --> 00:20:01.158
I figured this would happen.

00:20:02.951 --> 00:20:05.037
That's Lü Bu for you!

00:20:05.954 --> 00:20:07.039
Quite right.

00:20:07.122 --> 00:20:09.458
What the heck is with that human?

00:20:09.541 --> 00:20:12.085
What a cocky, disrespectful boor!

00:20:12.628 --> 00:20:14.922
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:15.005 --> 00:20:17.299
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:17.382 --> 00:20:19.551
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:19.635 --> 00:20:22.179
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:22.262 --> 00:20:24.640
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:24.723 --> 00:20:26.808
That's my lord!

00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:29.394
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:29.478 --> 00:20:31.813
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:31.897 --> 00:20:33.857
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:33.941 --> 00:20:36.401
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:20:36.902 --> 00:20:41.365
Brünnhilde,
is that guy really going to be all right?

00:20:42.032 --> 00:20:46.078
Doesn't it seem like Lü Bu
is the one scoffing at the gods?

00:20:46.954 --> 00:20:49.957
This must be how the greatest humans live.

00:21:04.012 --> 00:21:05.597
Thor and Lü Bu.

00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:09.601
These dissimilar men have
only a single thing in common.

00:21:10.352 --> 00:21:13.605
They have vanquished
